              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikawa baada ya hayo, Nahashi, mfalme wa wana wa Amoni, akafa, akamiliki mwanawe mahali pake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi akasema, Nitamtendea wema Hanuni, mwana wa Nahashi, kwa kuwa babaye alinitendea mimi wema. Basi Daudi akapeleka wajumbe ili kumtuliza kwa habari za babaye. Wakaja watumishi wa Daudi katika nchi ya wana wa Amoni kwa Hanuni, ili wamtulize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wakuu wa wana wa Amoni wakamwambia Hanuni, Je! Waona Daudi amheshimu babayo kwa kukupelekea wafariji? Je! Hawakukujia watumishi wake ili kuiangalia nchi, na kuiangamiza, na kuipeleleza? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Hanuni akawatwaa watumishi wa Daudi, akawanyoa, akawakatia nguo zao katikati, hata matakoni, akawatoa waende zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 6:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.6.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
                  "type": "text"
